description:
  Test is to verify that config_memtest variable is configured in the kernel when setting memtest=1 and booting the machine
  memtest will occur

Test inputs:
    /boot/config-$(uname -r) or /usr/lib/ostree-boot/config-$(uname -r) for ostree
    /tmp/dmesg_temp.txt
    CONFIG_MEMTEST=y
    "early_memtest"
    "memtest=1"

Expected result:
    [   PASS   ] :: File '/boot/config-5.14.0-473.424.el9iv.aarch64' should contain 'CONFIG_MEMTEST=y'
    [   PASS   ] :: File '/tmp/dmesg_temp.txt' should contain 'early_memtest'

Results location:
    output.txt
